ntext size at each model decision is recorded in the trace.\n35\t\n36\t**How to verify:** 1) Find model call sites and their spans. 2) Look for the context size recorded per call (for example `gen_ai.usage.input_tokens` or a context-length attribute). 3) Answer no if it is missing on any model call path, including retries and sub-agents.\n37\t\n38\t**Reviewer's evidence:** src/agent/loop.ts:69 — \"context: contextSize,\"\n39\t\n40\t**Reviewer's note:** Context size recorded for each decision\n41\t\n42\t`src/agent/loop.ts` lines 57–81 (cited lines marked >):\n43\t```\n44\t  57        await killSwitch.assertRunning(ctx.tenantId);\n45\t  58  \n46\t  59        const req = { model: AGENT_MODEL, system, tools, messages };\n47\t  60        const pre = await measureBeforeCall(anthropic, req, budget.signal);\n48\t  61        const res = await anthropic.messages.create({ ...req, max_tokens: 1024 }, { signal: budget.signal });\n49\t  62        const contextSize = completeFromUsage(pre, res.usage);\n50\t  63        await budget.recordUsage(res.usage, AGENT_MODEL);\n51\t  64  \n52\t  65        const toolUses = res.content.filter((b): b is Anthropic.ToolUseBlock => b.type === \"tool_use\");\n53\t  66        await audit.record({\n54\t  67          ...ident(),\n55\t  68          event: \"model.decision\",\n56\t  69>         context: contextSize,\n57\t  70          detail: {\n58\t  71            servedModel: res.model,\n59\t  72            stopReason: res.stop_reason,\n60\t  73            proposed: toolUses.map((t) => ({ id: t.id, name: t.name })),\n61\t  74            span: spanAttributes(contextSize),\n62\t  75          },\n63\t  76        });\n64\t  77  \n65\t  78        if (res.stop_reason !== \"tool_use\" || toolUses.length === 0) {\n66\t  79          const text = res.content\n67\t  80            .filter((b): b is Anthropic.TextBlock => b.type === \"text\")\n68\t  81            .map((b) => b.text)\n69\t```\n70\t\n71\t## C08.3\n72\t\n73\t**Check:** Prompts passed from a parent t